Subject: [PATCH] feat: upgrade homepage with about, philosophy, and stronger
 CTAs

Elevate the existing juhousing.co.kr home into a clearer brand story:
company intro, construction philosophy (Structure/Envelope/Trust),
hero mid/final consultation CTAs, refined copy, and content-driven
rendering via site-content.json.
